      "markdown": "Electronic condensate drains, typical example\n\n| Reference   | Designation                                                          |\n|-------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Da          | Automatic drain connection                                           |\n| Da1         | Automatic drain connection of the dryer (only on Full-Feature units) |"
